    "title": "Eclipse of Sun and Moon",
    "enTitle": "Eclipse of Sun and Moon",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "だって、私たち一緒にトゥインクル・シリーズを\n駆け抜けていくbuddiesなのよ？",
            "enText": "After all, together we're running the \nTwinkle Series, so we're buddies, right?",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 171,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 105,
                    "pathId": -4846603791737371625
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2221505689960403041,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "私はあなたをもっと知って、\nそしてあなたは私をもっと知る必要がある。",
            "enText": "I want to know more about you, \nand you need to learn more about me.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 183,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 194,
                    "pathId": 784450910879553312
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 2413616756471270626
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2538471659883544216,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "そのためにも、あなたともっといろんな時間を共有したい。\nもっといろんな経験をしたい――Don't you think so?",
            "enText": "And to do that, I want to spend more time with you. \nI need to experience lots of things. ――Don't you think so?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 255,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -8337991888994632389
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 29,
                    "pathId": 1778618723660448876
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6269861595928575753,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ということで誘われた、パーティー当日。\n衣装を持って会場に向かっていると……。",
            "enText": "And so, the day of the party arrived. \nI had my outfit in hand and was making my way to the venue……",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 95,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 46,
                    "pathId": -8233767860057005338
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 150,
                    "pathId": 8846335279153547722
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -8444847476915883549
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4164929726164896721,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "緊張してる？",
            "enText": "Nervous?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 43,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あ、ああ……少しな",
                    "enText": "Y-yeah……a little",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "う、うん……少しね",
                    "enText": "Y-yeah……a little",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 74,
                    "pathId": 3621627820941518748
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 115,
                    "pathId": 8134769749485077247
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2883809378436233228,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "まあそうよね。……でも、安心して？\nなんて言っても、今日は『テーマパーティー』だもの！",
            "enText": "No surprise there. ……But, don't worry. \nAfter all is said and done, today is a 『Theme Party』!",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 259,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 219,
                    "pathId": -1653872963971346336
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -1745270067937103959
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1632798974511582428,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "会場で『スパイ』の格好に着替えたら、\nきっとワクワクで全部吹っ飛ぶわ！　……We're fine!",
            "enText": "Once we're on site and changed in to our 『Spy』 outfits, I'm sure \nthe excitement will make you forget all about that! ……We're fine!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 234,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 5238225439690398958
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -4277514652994740586
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6801491480804513983,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "と言われていたものの……。",
            "enText": "Even though she said all that……",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 61,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -2686172152556354314
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1335651496280245010,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "――Wow.\nかわいいネズミが紛れ込んでるわね。",
            "enText": "――Wow. \nLooks like a cute little rat snuck its way in.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 138,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -5397652791781921147,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Checkmate――なんてね！　お待たせ、トレーナー！\nOh!　完璧な『オフィスワーカー風スパイ』じゃない♪",
            "enText": "Checkmate――Just kidding! Sorry for the wait, Trainer! \nOh! Aren't you the perfect 『Office Worker-style Spy』♪",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 357,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あ、ありがとう。君の格好は……",
                    "enText": "T-thanks. And your look is……",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "あ、ありがとう。貴方の格好は……",
                    "enText": "T-thanks. And your look is……",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 186,
                    "pathId": -302940665365389080
