            "pathId": -3857894031228505454,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "……正直に言うと、人前に出るのはあまり得意ではない。\nだが、デアリングハートのトレーナーなら……。",
            "enText": "……To be honest, I'm not very good with being in \nfront of a crowd. But since I'm Daring Heart's trainer……",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "で、出てみようかな……！",
                    "enText": "I-I think I'll join too……!",
                    "nextBlock": 21
