        {
            "jpName": "主催者ウマ娘",
            "enName": "Organizing Uma Musume",
            "jpText": "エージェントへの指令は――『今をときめくトップアイドル』！\nでは、どうぞ！",
            "enText": "This Agent's mission is――『The Rising Star――A Top Idol』! \nThen, if you please!",
            "nextBlock": 26,
