            "pathId": 4838203894321032403,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "緊張が限界まで達する中、頭の隅の冷静な自分が言う。\n……『どうせ倒れるなら前に倒れたほうが得だ』、と。",
            "enText": "As my nervousness peaked, I heard a calm voice in the back of my mind. \n……『If you're going to stumble, then stumble forward』",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 111,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
