            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "とはいえ、気力と体力ともに大幅に消費した。\nしばらく静かに過ごしたいが……。",
            "enText": "That said, it had all been extremely mentally \nand physically draining. I just wanted to relax but……",
